       [0., 1., 0.]]

  operator.shape
  ==> [3, 3]

  # This will be zero.
  operator.log_abs_determinant()
  ==> scalar Tensor

  x = ... Shape [3, 4] Tensor
  operator.matmul(x)
  ==> Shape [3, 4] Tensor
  ```

